/* Scenery background (sky + drifting clouds + bushes), tiled horizontally.
   The source strip is wide & short (bushes sit along its bottom edge). The
   ground tile itself has transparent padding above its grass (see
   STAGE_SURFACE_FRAC above), so the bottom of this background art needs to
   land on PLAYER_FEET_Y (the actual visible grass line), not GROUND_Y (the
   top of the ground tile) — otherwise the bushes appear to float over a
   sliver of visible sky before the grass starts. Scrolls slower than the
   ground for a simple parallax depth effect (clouds & bushes drifting by). */
